<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσείω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold out and shake</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χεῖρα</span>
			<i>shake</i> it <i>threateningly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1218
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσείειν ἀνασείειν τε [τὸν
				πλόκαμον</span>] <i>wave</i> it up and down, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				930
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γυμνὰ τὰ ξίφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					12.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλὸν π.</span>
			<i>wave</i> a bough <i>before</i> cattle, so as to lead them on,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				230d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θήρατρα τοῖς ὄρνισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.29
				</span></i>
			; and metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Σειρῆνας,
				αὐλητρίδας</span>, <i>hold</i> them <i>out as a
			bait</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				17.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φόβον</span>
			<i>hold</i> a thing <i>out</i> as a bugbear, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
